&=\beta_0+\sum_{j=1}^{J-1}\beta_j\log p_j-\Big(\sum_{j=1}^{J-1}\beta_j+\beta_{J+1}\Big)\log p_J+\beta_{J+1}\log Y+u \\
&=\beta_0+\sum_{j=1}^{J-1}\beta_j\log p_j-\sum_{j=1}^{J-1}\beta_j\log p_J-\beta_{J+1}\log p_J+\beta_{J+1}\log Y+u \\
